# Testing

- Unit: pure logic in `lib/`, state machine, URL parsing — Vitest, no mocks.
- Integration: services/repositories against real SQLite — no repository mocks.
- E2E: Playwright on production build for async RSC flows.
- No `waitForTimeout` — use assertion-driven waits.

Reference: `docs/09-testing-strategy.md`, `docs/16-test-guidelines.md`
